// Mind config overlay — enable HyDE (hypothetical document embeddings).
// Applied by `kb-env config mind-hyde` via kb-dev ensure --scenario; the
// platform re-reads it on service restart. Infra-free (no external server),
// so it is safe for hot-swap verification.
{
  "mind": {
    "retrieval": {
      "hyde": true
    }
  }
}
